      "created_at": "2020-09-16T19:40:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For the first part to me it says I can take up to two Dahan&nbsp;from an area I have Presense first. &nbsp; Then I look at lands with my presence which are connected and I can place them in any one of those. &nbsp; If I have board C for example with Presense lands 1, 2, 3, 6, and 8. &nbsp; If I choose land 1 then I can place those Dahan in any of those locations. &nbsp;If my Presense was at lands 1,2,3, 7, and 8 then if I pick land 1 I can only move it between lands&nbsp;1,2, and 3. &nbsp; If I pick 8 then I can only move it between 7 and 8. &nbsp; &nbsp;Does that help?</p>",
